 142               /               OF 'COMIN'.   ELIMINATION  OF 'OREM' IN FAVOR OF 'COMOUT'.  ADDED
 143               /               STATUS UPDATE ROUTINE ('UPSTATUS')  FOR EVENTUAL DECMATE II, ETC.
 144               /               USAGE.  ELIMINATED PDP-8, DECMATE  I,  DECMATE  II  CONDITIONALS.
