2950               /       ROUTINE TO MULTIPLY THE VALUE OF THE AC TIMES 10.
2951               /       VALUE IN THE AC IS ASSUMED BINARY.
2952               
2953               /       THE NUMBER IS RETURNED IN THE AC.  IF THE LINK IS SET THE MULTIPLY
2954               /       OVERFLOWED 12 BITS.
2955               
2956               MUL10,  0
2957                       DCA     MULTMP          /SAVE THE NUMBER
2958                       TAD     MULTMP          /GET THE NUMBER BACK
2959                       CLL RTL                 /MULTIPLY TIMES 4
2960                       TAD     MULTMP          /TIMES 5
2961                       SNL                     /SKIP IF ALREADY OVERFLOWED             /025 CJL
2962                       RAL                     /TIMES 10
