4055 003635  7104          CLL RAL                         /MOVE UP
4056 003636  1301          TAD     THIRD                   /GET OLD NYBBLE (IF ANY)
4057 003637  7006          RTL;RTL                         /MOVE UP NYBBLE BITS
     003640  7006  
4058 003641  3301          DCA     THIRD                   /SAVE FOR NEXT TIME
4059 003642  1761          TAD I   BUFPTR                  /GET LATEST WORD AGAIN
4060 003643  4246          JMS     PUTC                    /SEND BACK CURRENT BYTE
4061 003644  2361          ISZ     BUFPTR                  /BUMP TO NEXT WORD
