5891               /       AC      CPU TYPE
5892               
5893               /       0       UNKNOWN (DCC112, MP-12?)
5894               /       1       PDP-5 (THE INCOMPATIBLE ONE!)
5895               /       2       PDP-8 (THE REAL ONE!)
5896               /       3       PDP-8/S (THE SLOW ONE!)
5897               /       4       LINC-8 (THE STRANGE ONE!)
5898               /       5       PDP-8/I (THE ORANGE ONE!)
5899               /       6       PDP-8/L (THE STRIPPED-DOWN ONE!)
5900               /       7       PDP-12 (THE GREEN ONE! (BLUE?))
5901               /       10      PDP-8/E (THE FAST ONE!)
5902               /       11      PDP-8/A (THE WIDE ONE!)
5903               /       12      6100 (THE MICRO ONE!)
5904               /       13      6120 (THE HARRIS ONE!)
