5916 007007  3000          DCA     0               /RESTORE IT
5917 007010  7354          NL3776                  /PDP-8/I, L WEIRDNESS
5918 007011  1376          TAD     (-3776)         /COMPARE TO POSSIBLE VALUE
5919 007012  7650          SNA CLA                 /SKIP IF NOT THOSE TWO
5920 007013  5234          JMP     IMA8IL          /JUMP IF ONE OF THEM
5921               
