5923               
5924 007014  7344          NL7776                  /SETUP -2
5925 007015  1375          TAD     (-7776)         /COMPARE TO EXPECTED VALUE
5926 007016  7640          SZA CLA                 /SKIP IF OK
5927 007017  5276          JMP     IMA8S           /JUMP IF RETARDED BROTHER
